* Edit 1: Replace series inductor with shunt inductor for input matching
* Shunt L (L4) across VIN1 and ground, replacing C1+L1 series with L4||C1
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L4 VIN1 VSS
NMOS NM1 n2 VSS n3 VSS
L L2 n3 VSS
